title: Komuch
subtitle: Volsky builds a government on the Volga with an armed force. Support among peasants +3, middle strata +2; relations with the Bolsheviks −6; repression +4; the Right SRs: strength +2, dissent −4; the Left SRs: dissent +5; the party takes up arms: a government on the Volga, relying on foreign aid; raises the White front.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and bol_regime = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : [+ advisor_wait +] months before the next advisor action. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 and advisor_action_timer <= 1 : One month before the next advisor action. ?][? if not (bol_regime = 1) : There is no Bolshevik government to fight. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.armed_struggle = 1; Q.white_aid += 1; Q.komuch_alive = 1; RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: -6, repression: 4}); RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 3, middle: 2}); RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 2, -4); RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 5);
!}

Volsky's Komuch has a government, a flag and an army of volunteers. It also has to rely on foreign bayonets.

