title: Compromise
subtitle: Volsky opens talks with the soviets. Relations with the Bolsheviks +6; repression −2; the Ufa delegation: strength +3, dissent −3; the Right SRs: dissent +6; the Left SRs: dissent −3.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and bol_regime = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : [+ advisor_wait +] months before the next advisor action. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 and advisor_action_timer <= 1 : One month before the next advisor action. ?][? if not (bol_regime = 1) : There is no Bolshevik government to talk to. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
Q.month_actions += 1;
RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: 6, repression: -2}); RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 3, -3); RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 6); RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -3);
!}

Volsky sent word to the Soviet government that the party was ready to talk. The Right SRs call it a betrayal, and the peasants call it common sense.

